SUMMARY:The Artist’s Voice: Lucy Raven with Ruth Erickson
LOCATION:ICA\, 25 Harbor Shore Dr\, Boston\, MA 02210
DESCRIPTION:Lucy Raven’s work explores the physical and mythical landscap
 es of the American West\, as seen in her mesmerizing film installation—M
 urderers Bar. Witness the transformation of a landscape and embrace the su
 bsequent release of energy and force through the largest dam removal proje
 ct in North America. Join Raven and Ruth Erickson\, Barbara Lee Chief Cura
 tor and Director of Curatorial Affairs at the ICA\, in East Boston’s ICA
  Watershed for a morning conversation about her ongoing work centering ind
 ustry and the American landscape. Coffee and breakfast snacks will be prov
 ided\, as supplies last.\nhttps://www.icaboston.org/events/the-artists-voi
 ce-lucy-raven-with-ruth-erickson/\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.ci
